# slug: ch61-transaction
# source: chapters/ch61.tex:157
# label: alg:ch61-transaction
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch61.tex:160
# caption: Commit an IR rewrite against the snapshot it actually inspected.

REQUIRE immutable snapshot S, proposed edits D, current revision owner
ENSURE either one valid new snapshot or no published change
construct candidate snapshot S' from S and D
check types, dominance, edge arity, and required effect ordering in S'
enter the serialized publication operation
IF the current snapshot is not S THEN
  RETURN stale result
END IF
publish S' with new input stamps and recorded provenance
RETURN committed

